n_translation_id":85,"en":"What about the one who has been sentenced to punishment? Can you [Prophet] rescue those already in the Fire?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَنْ","en_gloss":"Then, is (one) who","transliteration":"afaman","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَقَّ","en_gloss":"became due","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"on him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَلِمَةُ","en_gloss":"the word","transliteration":"kalimatu","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"(of) the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَفَأَنتَ","en_gloss":"Then can you","transliteration":"afa-anta","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُنقِذُ","en_gloss":"save","transliteration":"tunqidhu","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(one) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"39:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:19"}]},{"verse_key":"39:20","surah":39,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"لَـٰكِنِ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّقَوْا۟ رَبَّهُمْ لَهُمْ غُرَفٌ مِّن فَوْقِهَا غُرَفٌ مَّبْنِيَّةٌ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ وَعْدَ ٱللَّهِ ۖ لَا يُخْلِفُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْمِيعَادَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those who are mindful of their Lord will have lofty dwellings built for them, one above the other, graced with flowing streams. This is a promise from God: God does not break His promise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَـٰكِنِ","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"lākini","verse_key":"39:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"39:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوْا۟","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"39:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","translite